          "id": "SP_MELOIDOGYNE_ENTEROLOBII_YANG_EISENBACK_1983",
          "name": "Meloidogyne enterolobii Yang & Eisenback, 1983",
          "rank": "SPECIES",
          "commonName": "",
          "lineage": "Meloidogyne",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "This rather recently described species is now considered a cosmopolitan, economically important nematode with a broad host range (Castillo and Castagnone-Sereno, 2020). Meloidogyne enterolobii induced many galls on infested industrial hemp plants in the field and on the industrial cv. Longma No. 5 in greenhouse tests (Ren et al., 2020); these authors considered M. enterolobii to be a major potential threat to hemp production. The average Rf in the greenhouse experiments was 18.2.",
          "sourcedFrom": "gbif",
          "wikipediaTitle": "gbif:7024698"
